The isolated FP4 scale-expansion experiment uses the Apache-2.0-licensed
MxWave CT grouped-Marlin integration, Copyright MxWave contributors, as an
explicit external build input. build_fp4_scale_expansion.py records and verifies
the exact five input source hashes and recreates every staged source hash from
the qualified CT build before applying its optional change.

