driver are Copyright 2026 Kyrylo Bilchenko, Apache-2.0 (repository LICENSE).
The existing selector order and whole-vector exception format are unchanged.
The optional final-prefetch guard removes a dead shared-B register load before
the existing shared-memory reduction, identically in both rebuilt controls.
The alternative reuse barrier orders all shared-B reads before that reduction
overwrites the same storage, without adding a condition to the inner loop.
No external source file or installed vLLM package is modified.
